### ================================================================
### HYOPE SERVER API TEST
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### ================================================================


### ================================================================
### 1. GUARDIAN
### ================================================================

### [1-1] 보호자 전체 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/guardian
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [1-2] 보호자 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/guardian/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [1-3] 보호자 생성 (회원가입)
POST http://localhost:8080/guardian
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "user2",
  "password": "abcd1234",
  "firstName": "CHUL SU",
  "lastName": "KIM",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-20",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phoneNumber": "01098765432",
  "email": "chulsu@gmail.com"
}

###

### [1-4] 보호자 정보 수정 (부분 수정)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/guardian/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "01099999999"
}

###

### [1-5] 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/guardian/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "user2",
  "password": "abcd1234"
}

###

### [1-6] 보호자 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/guardian/1
Content-Type: application/json


### ================================================================
### 2. RECIPIENT
### ================================================================

### [2-1] 돌봄대상자 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/recipient/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [2-2] 특정 보호자의 돌봄대상자 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/guardian/1/recipient
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [2-3] 돌봄대상자 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/guardian/1/recipient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guardian_id": 1,
  "firstName": "SOON JA",
  "lastName": "KIM",
  "birthDate": "1950-03-15",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "phoneNumber": "01011112222",
  "relationToGuardian": "PARENT"
}

###

### [2-4] 돌봄대상자 정보 수정 (부분 수정)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/recipient/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "01033334444"
}

###

### [2-5] 돌봄대상자 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/recipient/1
Content-Type: application/json


### ================================================================
### 3. CALL SCHEDULE
### ================================================================

### [3-1] 전화 일정 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/call-schedule/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [3-2] 특정 돌봄대상자의 전화 일정 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/recipient/1/call-schedule
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [3-3] 전화 일정 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/recipient/1/call-schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient_id": 1,
  "scheduledTime": "09:00:00",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### [3-4] 전화 일정 수정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/call-schedule/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

###

### [3-5] 전화 일정 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/call-schedule/1
Content-Type: application/json


### ================================================================
### 4. CALL LOG
### ================================================================

### [4-1] 통화 기록 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/call-log/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [4-2] 특정 돌봄대상자의 통화 기록 목록 조회 (페이징)
GET http://localhost:8080/recipient/1/call-log?page=0&size=20
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [4-3] 기간별 통화 기록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/recipient/1/call-log/by-date?from=2025-01-01T00:00:00&to=2025-12-31T23:59:59
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [4-4] 상태별 통화 기록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/recipient/1/call-log/by-status?status=COMPLETED
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [4-5] 통화 기록 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/recipient/1/call-log
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient_id": 1,
  "startedAt": "2025-01-02T07:00:00",
  "endedAt": "2025-01-02T07:04:00",
  "durationSec": 0,
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

###

### [4-6] 통화 기록 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/call-log/1
Content-Type: application/json


### ================================================================
### 5. CALL LOG ENTRY
### ================================================================

### [5-1] 항목 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/call-log-entry/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [5-2] 특정 통화 기록의 항목 목록 조회 (페이징)
GET http://localhost:8080/call-log/1/call-log-entry?page=0&size=20
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [5-3] 특정 통화 기록의 항목 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/call-log/1/call-log-entry/all
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [5-4] 항목 1건 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/call-log/1/call-log-entry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "call_log_id": 1,
  "sequence": 4,
  "question": "오늘 운동 하셨나요?",
  "answer": "아니, 못 했어.",
  "askedAt": "2025-01-01T07:02:30"
}

###

### [5-5] 항목 여러 건 일괄 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/call-log/1/call-log-entry/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "call_log_id": 1,
    "sequence": 5,
    "question": "잠은 잘 주무셨나요?",
    "answer": "잘 잤어.",
    "askedAt": "2025-01-01T07:03:00"
  },
  {
    "call_log_id": 1,
    "sequence": 6,
    "question": "오늘 날씨 어때요?",
    "answer": "좀 흐린 것 같아.",
    "askedAt": "2025-01-01T07:03:30"
  }
]

###

### [5-6] 항목 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/call-log-entry/1
Content-Type: application/json


### ================================================================
### 6. ASSESSMENT
### ================================================================

### [6-1] 평가 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/assessment/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [6-2] 특정 돌봄대상자의 평가 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/recipient/1/assessment
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [6-3] 평가 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/recipient/1/call-log/1/assessment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient_id": 1,
  "call_log_id": 1,
  "measuredAt": "2025-01-01T07:04:00",
  "depressionScore": 2.0,
  "emotionalStability": 3.0,
  "healthRisk": 1.0,
  "cognitiveScore": 5.5,
  "overallRisk": 5.0,
  "riskLevel": "CAUTION",
  "summary": "전체적으로 양호한 상태이나, 지속적인 관찰이 필요해보인다.",
  "recommendation": "상담/대화 봇 통화량을 늘리거나 방문 봉사 서비스 추천"
}

###

### [6-4] 평가 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/assessment/1
Content-Type: application/json


### ================================================================
### 7. ADHERENCE RECORD
### ================================================================

### [7-1] 이행 기록 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/adherence-record/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [7-2] 특정 평가의 이행 기록 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/assessment/1/adherence-record
Content-Type: application/json

###

### [7-3] 이행 기록 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/assessment/1/adherence-record
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assessment_id": 1,
  "adherenceType": "MEAL",
  "slot": "LUNCH",
  "isNeeded": true,
  "isDone": false
}

###

### [7-4] 이행 기록 수정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/adherence-record/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isDone": true
}

###

### [7-5] 이행 기록 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/adherence-record/1
Content-Type: application/json